{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50538","headline":"舞词 · 张鷟","name":"舞词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从来巡遶四边，忽逢两个神仙。\n眉上冬天出柳，颊中旱地生莲。\n千看千处妩媚，万看万处㛹妍。\n今宵若其不得，剩命过与黄泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张鷟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}